      "content": "\"step off the track\"? i dont think u get it. i mean, if you look at it logically, if everything is eventually going to end and nothing we do actually matters in the grand scheme of things, then the value of living vs the value of not living is basically zero. it's like a math equation that just cancels itself out. so why is staying in the loop considered the \"right\" answer? it doesn't seem logical.",
